  "content": "# 第25题\n\n**题型**: 选择题\n\n**难度**: ★★☆☆☆\n\n**分值**: 2分\n\n---\n\n## 题目内容\n\n25. How did Grant Brown’s presentation influence Alice?\n\n## 选项\n\nA. A. She decided to do something for nature.\n\nB. B. She tasted the sweetness of friendship.\n\nC. C. She learned about the harm of desire.\n\nD. D. She built up her courage to speak up.\n\n---\n\n## 参考答案\n\nA\n\n",
  "answer": "C",
  "analysis": "本题考查连词辨析。A项‘虽然’；B项‘因为’；C项‘除非’；D项‘如果’。句意：除非你努力学习，否则你考试会不及格。故选C。"
